      "title": "Arc for macOS - 2023 Release Notes",
      "section": "## November 30, 2023 —",
      "source_text_line": 56,
      "text": "* It's now possible to mute a tab in Split View by right-clicking on the split and selecting \"Mute\" under the tab's name. It's also now possible to duplicate a split in the tab's right-click menu.",
      "saved_file": "official-docs/20498377604887.md"
